  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nigeria Smart Grid Reverse Trade Mission, through Futron Corporation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Initiative supports U.S. private sector participation in the implementation of smart grid transmission and distribution projects in Nigeria. The Initiative, which includes a Reverse Trade Mission and a Workshop, seeks to expose U.S. suppliers of technologies and services to market, project development, and procurement opportunities in Nigeria. The initiative also seeks to expose Nigerian decision makers to U.S. electricity distribution technologies and services, as well as policies, regulations, and financing mechanisms that can support the implementation of smart grid projects in Nigeria.</narrative>
  </description>
